<title>UK: Muenchener Hypo sets 300 mln mark step-up bond.</title>
<headline>Muenchener Hypo sets 300 mln mark step-up bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager WGZ Bank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   MUENCHENER HYPOTHEKENBANK</p>
<p> AMT    300 MLN DEM   COUPON   **4.25	MATURITY  **26.JUN.01</p>
<p> TYPE   STEP-UP	 ISS PRICE  101.25    PAY DATE    26.MAR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.35	LISTING    MUNICH    PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> NOTES    **CALL 26.JUN.97 AT PAR, WHEN COUPON THEN STEPS UP TO</p>
<p>		4.7 PCT</p>
<p> DENOMS (K) 10	  MGT/UND    0.10	SELL CONC   1.25</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
